Subject: [PATCH 56/63] [cuttlefish] Update status and host_bugreport for
 registry-aware config
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Summary:
# Motivation:
Developers running multiple emulator types simultaneously on macOS in independent instance mode have no global config symlink, so cvd_status and cvd_host_bugreport cannot find instances without registry fallback.

```
  cvd_status --instance_num=1          cvd_status --all_instances
       |                                    |
       v                                    v
  registry lookup(1)                   registry.list()
       |                                    |
       v                                    v
  load config for instance 1           load config for each instance
  query launcher monitor               query each launcher monitor
  print status                         print all statuses

  cvd_host_bugreport (no global config)
       |
       v
  registry.list() ──> enumerate instances
       |
       v
  collect logs from each instance config
```

# Overview:
Update cvd_status to support --instance_num (query single instance from registry) and --all_instances (enumerate all from registry when no monolithic config). Update cvd_host_bugreport to enumerate instances from the registry when no monolithic config is available, collecting logs from each independent instance's config.

Test Plan:
```
cd /Volumes/AOSP && source build/envsetup.sh && lunch aosp_cf_arm64_phone-userdebug && m out/host/darwin-x86/cvd-host_package.tar.gz

HOME=~/.device/cache/emulators/<device>_cf_emu_arm64-37930000003761-2086149158896680 ./bin/cvd_status --all_instances
```

